message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "peff_uniprot_fetcher: Fetch UniProt protein data and generate PEFF (PSI Extended FASTA Format) files"
abstract: >-
  peff_uniprot_fetcher generates PEFF (PSI Extended FASTA Format) files from
  the UniProt REST API. It fetches protein sequences and GFF annotations
  (natural variants, PTMs, processed forms) and writes them as annotated PEFF
  using pefftacular, with modification mapping backed by psimodpy, unimodpy,
  and uniprotptmpy. It requires Python 3.12 or later.
